# sw_cam (D308-85, Spec 11.23): shoulder camera A/B (x 0 / .5 / .7) on 가 · 노 · 소, then the finals of one initial side by side (가 간 갓 강 · 나 난 낫 낭) at x .6.
# Builds first (build: trails on the five, attack: final bolts / hits, giyeok: the ㄱ marker). The config offset is put back in finally (and on Play exit).
